e/GetItems/v1/","context":{"app_id":4928080,"app_scope":"base","country":"KR","language":"koreana","batch_size":100,"review_scope":"store_summary_filtered","percentage_precision":"source_rounded_integer","review_score_label":"사용자 평가 없음"},"error_code":"no_reviews"}],"events":[{"id":"steam-steam-4928080-1846651706695657","game_id":"steam-4928080","kind":"announcement","title":"Seikyu Let's Go to Next Fest! New gameplay in Demo","summary":"Hello, little yokai friends!Seikyu Let's Go has arrived at Steam Next Fest! From October 19 to 26, you're welcome to visit our Steam store page to download the Demo and try it for free. Grab your friends and set off on a wobbly, hilarious road trip together~(The Playtest version will no longer be updated, so please move over to the Demo version.)https://store.steampowered.com/app/4928080/_/First of all, a special thank-you to everyone! Over the weekend, your enthusiasm far exceeded our expectati","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-20T15:08:29Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706695657","verified_at":"2026-10-20T18:50:27Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4928080-1846651706690506","game_id":"steam-4928080","kind":"announcement","title":"New updates for Demo ｜Seikyu Let's Go","summary":"Hello, players!Over the weekend, thousands of players came to try our Demo every day and gave us correct, constructive, and practical criticism. First of all, thank you all for \"dropping by\" to experience our little game; tomorrow is the New Product Festival, and we'll also be updating the game to bring you some fun and exciting new gameplay~At the same time, we're very sorry that because the Demo version was released in a rush, there are a large number of bugs, game performance optimization iss","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-19T14:25:43Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706690506","verified_at":"2026-10-20T18:50:27Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4928080-1846651706683620","game_id":"steam-4928080","kind":"announcement","title":"RV Renovation Gameplay Is Live! Build Your Own Cozy Mobile Home with Friends","summary":"Hello, players!The new Demo version is now updated — the RV renovation gameplay is implemented!Now, the RV on your journey is no longer just a means of transportation — it's your cozy mobile home: collect coins along the way, unlock all kinds of furniture, accessories, and decorative items from gacha machines and treasure chests, freely mix and match to furnish your own RV, and create a one-of-a-kind cute travel base~Grab your friends and hop on board — decorate your RV into the ideal space you'","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-17T02:09:11Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706683620","verified_at":"2026-10-20T18:50:27Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4928080-1846651706673810","game_id":"steam-4928080","kind":"announcement","title":"The Demo Is Here! Let's Go! 🚐","summary":"Hello Seikyuians,We’re so excited to share that the Seikyu Let’s Go! demo is live! 😊After sharing our first look at the game, we can finally invite you to jump in and experience the journey for yourself.Grab your friends, hop into a campervan built by yokai, and hit the road for a cozy and chaotic adventure across the wilds of Seikyu.Up to 4 players can travel together, explore mysterious locations, solve puzzles, discover hidden creatures, cook around the campfire, and create your own unforgett","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-14T10:10:18Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706673810","verified_at":"2026-10-20T18:50:27Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4928080-1844751498230289","game_id":"steam-4928080","kind":"announcement","title":"Introducing Seikyu Let’s Go, a New Adventure! 🚐","summary":"Hello Seikyians, We are so excited to finally announce our new adventure: Seikyu Let’s Go! Let’s Go is set in the same world you love and adore. It’s a cozy 1-4 player online co-op road trip that we hope you’ll love exploring together! ⛺ What is Let’s Go? Seabert and Kon, yes those two 👀, have made Seikyu into a lovely travel destination thanks to their photography turning up in Yokai magazines and newspapers. And now they have invited adventurers to come and see it for themselves! Team up and t","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-28T02:00:43Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1844751498230289","verified_at":"2026-10-20T18:50:27Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"}],"analyses":[],"news_status":{"steam-4928080":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T05:30:27Z","status":"ok","all_sources_checked_at":"2026-10-26T05:30:27Z","error_codes":[]}},"news_last_attempt_at":{"steam-4928080":"2026-10-26T05:30:27Z"},"notices":[],"news_sources":{"4928080":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T05:30:27Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T05:30:27Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[]},"5269150":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T05:30:27Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T05:30:27Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[]}},"context_snapshots":[{"schema_version":1,"game_id":"steam-4928080","app_id":4928080,"app_scope":"base","observed_at":"2026-10-26T06:15:08Z","source_url":"https://api.steampowered.com/IStoreBrowseService/GetItems/v1/","context":{"country":"KR","language":"koreana","batch_size":100},"status":"ok","error_code":null,"store_item_success":1,"raw_item_sha